{"parse": {"title": "死生对位-03", "pageid": 134864, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-02\" title=\"死生对位-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">死生对位-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-04\" title=\"死生对位-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">死生对位</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8F.AF.E8.83.BD.E6.80.A7.E7.9A.84.E7.9C.9F.E4.BC.AA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"可能性的真伪\">可能性的真伪</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 可能性的真伪</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Verification of Possibility</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuezoulang\"><img alt=\"daxuezoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/600px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/900px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/1200px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>玛格丽特——玛格丽特——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呼喊声伴随着急促的脚步靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>有事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>你下课后走得太快了，我跑了好长一段路才追上你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>我只是想说，太好了！我们的双人协作果然拿到了最高的评价。我知道这大多数都是你的功劳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>不，不是的。是你的功劳，安妮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>选题计划与数据分析都是你做的，我只不过是完成了整理的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷漠的转学生紧紧地盯着面前的女孩，看见对方的脸庞上如她所想地露出笑容，酒窝像一个浅浅的坑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于是她也如同对方一样，控制着面上的肌肉，扯动嘴角——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>终于，她露出了一个同安妮如出一辙的微笑。一次完美的模仿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>你终于笑了，玛格丽特。这是我这么长时间以来第一次看见你笑得这么开心……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>当然，我也很开心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你是一个非常值得我学习的对象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>我吗……？我到底有什么值得你学习的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你很温柔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">过度的同理心。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>也很无私。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">无法分清对象的宽容。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>总是考虑许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">因此不受重视。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>这给我很大的启发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>我已经想明白了：我要像你一样融入这个环境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>你的直白吓了我一跳，玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>但其实，你是我在剑桥交到的第一个朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>谢谢你，谢谢你……玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>谢谢你，玛格丽特！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>从小组获批成立到现在才一个月的时间，我们已经把野外考察的框架搭好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>第一版安全条例是黑墙熬夜增补的细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>她的细心和审慎才是安全条例能通过审批的最大功臣。得益于这个无比完善的条例，我们能把撤离时间推迟至“暴雨”前一个半小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>噢，当然，黑墙也是大功臣。我应该郑重地向你们道谢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你说话太夸张了，蕾切尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我只是想看看，这个课题究竟能导向什么样的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>在如今的科算中心，几乎没有第二个课题是和神秘学毫无关系的了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十足温馨的场面。面色苍白的研究员自然地融入其中，没有丝毫突兀感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>在“暴雨”改变一切之后，只专注科学研究的小组们纷纷解散，只有蕾切尔还在坚持用纯粹的科学来分析“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>即使人们都认为这不可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>至少玛格丽特也相信我可以做到！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>每个想法和课题都有它存在的意义，可能性一旦存在，就值得去验证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>那个太过著名的牛顿与苹果，也来源于一瞬的灵光，或者许多个灵光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>眼见苹果落地，推导出万有引力定律，再到广义相对论的重构。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>没错，对我来说，证明科学依然可以解构“暴雨”后的世界完全是头等大事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你也是这么想的吗，黑墙研究员？渴望用科学的秩序来理解世界的混乱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她温和的注视让黑墙感到不适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>为什么要问我？我的想法并不重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>科研对我来说只是一处象牙塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然的冷肃使蕾切尔也噤声不语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一时间，办公室里只剩下纸笔摩擦和摁动按键的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>啊！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蕾切尔站了起来，从最上层的箱子里取出了那支不断鸣响的通讯器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>在刚刚，司辰发布了“暴雨”倒计时二十四小时预警。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>外出观测“暴雨”前环流变化的时机到了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "死生对位-03"}}